rada entre SINAPRED e INETER e el año\n2019.<span style='background-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);'></span>","license":"","copyright":"","fields":[{"name":"FID","type":"esriFieldTypeOID","alias":"FID","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","nullable":false,"editable":false,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null},{"name":"ID","type":"esriFieldTypeInteger","alias":"ID","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","nullable":true,"editable":false,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null},{"name":"GRIDCODE","type":"esriFieldTypeInteger","alias":"GRIDCODE","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","nullable":true,"editable":false,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null},{"name":"Regisro","type":"esriFieldTypeString","alias":"Registro","sqlType":"sqlTypeOther","length":254,"nullable":true,"editable":false,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null},{"name":"Shape__Area","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble","alias":"Shape__Area","sqlType":"sqlTypeDouble","nullable":true,"editable":false,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null},{"name":"Shape__Length","type":"esriFieldTypeDouble","alias":"Shape__Length","sqlType":"sqlTypeDouble","nullable":true,"editable":false,"domain":null,"defaultValue":null}],"editing_info":{"lastEditDate":1620746274245,"schemaLastEditDate":1620746274245,"dataLastEditDate":1620746274245},"warning":"Reference geometry; layer publication or edit time does not establish observation time."},{"id":"63ee025aea434bd1bc26d9d67a751738","title_source":"Ruta de huracanes","url":"https://services3.arcgis.com/gcPaotyuZyboHMjH/arcgis/rest/services/Ruta_de_huracanes/FeatureServer/0","description":"<div style='text-align:Left;'><div><p><span>El presente mapa (shape) en formato linea donde muestra la trayectoria de los diferentes eventos ciclonicos que han afectado a Nicaragua. desde 1893 hasta 1971. Esta capa está a escala 1:1000,0000 fue generado por el entonces Instituto Geográfico Nacional de Nicaragua en 1973. Fue digitalizado por INETER en 1995 </span></p></div></div>","license":"","copyright":"INETER-MARENA 1997","fields":[{"name":"FID","type":"esriFieldTypeOID","